        <p class="faq-q">What production models do apparel manufacturers offer?</p>
        <p class="faq-a">Certified apparel manufacturers typically offer OEM (produce to your specifications), ODM/private label (factory handles design and production), and CMT (you supply fabric, factory cuts, sews, finishes). SDF offers all three from 300 pieces per style.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
