      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <p class="faq-q">How does pricing work with apparel manufacturers?</p>
        <p class="faq-a">SDF quotes FOB — covering fabric, production, AQL inspection, branding, and export packing. No hidden charges. Payment: 30% deposit to start, 70% before shipment. T/T, L/C, and bank transfer accepted.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0;">
